1
00:01:08,660 --> 00:01:10,789
Pick the right place if you want to die.

2
00:01:21,960 --> 00:01:23,430
If you wake up my wife,

3
00:01:23,800 --> 00:01:25,700
I'll smash your heads.

4
00:01:41,560 --> 00:01:42,620
Get out of here now,

5
00:01:42,830 --> 00:01:44,430
and I might spare your lives.

6
00:02:00,700 --> 00:02:02,760
So your weakness is the God of War.

7
00:02:16,030 --> 00:02:16,960
Courting death.

8
00:02:47,000 --> 00:02:48,560
I wanted to let you go,

9
00:02:49,130 --> 00:02:51,260
but it's a pity you're tired of living.

10
00:03:06,400 --> 00:03:07,600
Sleeping so soundly.

11
00:03:08,200 --> 00:03:11,500
You didn't even wake up when you were almost stabbed in the back.

12
00:03:11,500 --> 00:03:13,130
Good thing you didn't wake up,

13
00:03:13,130 --> 00:03:14,730
or you'd scold me again.

14
00:03:25,660 --> 00:03:26,460
Cangyuan,

15
00:03:27,260 --> 00:03:28,030
wake up.

16
00:03:31,430 --> 00:03:32,260
You're awake.

17
00:03:32,600 --> 00:03:33,360
My wife,

18
00:03:33,860 --> 00:03:35,500
why do you look so pale?

19
00:03:36,030 --> 00:03:37,260
I'm fine, my wife.

20
00:03:37,800 --> 00:03:39,760
Last night I dreamed I fought ten people at once,

21
00:03:39,760 --> 00:03:41,490
looking incredibly handsome.

22
00:03:41,560 --> 00:03:44,290
I guess I got too tired from fighting in the dream.

23
00:03:45,130 --> 00:03:47,190
Too tired from fighting in the dream.

24
00:03:52,200 --> 00:03:53,329
Then tell me,

25
00:03:53,500 --> 00:03:54,660
what is this about?

26
00:03:57,400 --> 00:03:58,560
You found out.

27
00:03:59,000 --> 00:03:59,960
I wanted to keep a low profile,

28
00:03:59,960 --> 00:04:01,760
but my strength is just too great.

29
00:04:01,760 --> 00:04:02,360
Actually,

30
00:04:02,760 --> 00:04:03,900
to tell you the truth,

31
00:04:03,900 --> 00:04:05,700
I went to watch a show last night.

32
00:04:05,760 --> 00:04:06,560
Watch a show?

33
00:04:07,160 --> 00:04:08,000
What show?

34
00:04:10,800 --> 00:04:13,860
Two wild boars were fighting for territory in the woods at night.

35
00:04:13,860 --> 00:04:15,400
I went out to break up the fight

36
00:04:15,400 --> 00:04:17,130
and got accidentally injured.

37
00:04:19,500 --> 00:04:20,959
Wild boars can use swords?

38
00:04:21,300 --> 00:04:22,960
Those wild boars have cultivated into spirits,

39
00:04:22,960 --> 00:04:24,560
the kind that can use swords.

40
00:04:25,360 --> 00:04:26,060
Cangyuan,

41
00:04:26,300 --> 00:04:27,330
if you don't tell the truth,

42
00:04:27,330 --> 00:04:28,130
I'm leaving.

43
00:04:28,130 --> 00:04:30,860
You can stay here and make up stories by yourself.

44
00:04:33,360 --> 00:04:34,659
If I tell the truth,

45
00:04:34,659 --> 00:04:36,060
promise you won't be mad?

46
00:04:36,600 --> 00:04:37,460
Speak.

47
00:04:38,530 --> 00:04:40,060
Who exactly hurt you?

48
00:04:40,960 --> 00:04:42,090
Who else could it be?

49
00:04:42,430 --> 00:04:43,630
The fairies who chased me from the South Heaven Gate

50
00:04:43,630 --> 00:04:45,230
all the way to the entrance of the Demon Realm.

51
00:04:45,230 --> 00:04:46,490
Love turned into hate.

52
00:04:47,100 --> 00:04:48,360
Since they couldn't get my heart,

53
00:04:48,360 --> 00:04:49,930
they wanted to destroy me.

54
00:04:49,930 --> 00:04:50,900
I told them

55
00:04:50,900 --> 00:04:51,860
I'm already married

56
00:04:51,860 --> 00:04:53,260
and to stop pestering me.

57
00:04:55,800 --> 00:04:57,060
Ouch.

58
00:04:59,760 --> 00:05:01,760
Try talking nonsense one more time.

59
00:05:04,300 --> 00:05:05,300
Fine.

60
00:05:05,400 --> 00:05:06,600
Enemies from the Heaven Realm.

61
00:05:06,600 --> 00:05:08,230
They've been chasing and fighting me for hundreds of years.

62
00:05:08,230 --> 00:05:09,890
Just enemies on a narrow path.

63
00:05:10,130 --> 00:05:11,000
Enemies?

64
00:05:12,030 --> 00:05:14,560
Cangyuan, they came for me, didn't they?

65
00:05:15,160 --> 00:05:16,930
From the day I first met you,

66
00:05:17,730 --> 00:05:19,060
you've been lying to me.

67
00:05:21,130 --> 00:05:21,960
Who are you?

68
00:05:22,600 --> 00:05:24,730
Why are these people trying to kill me?

69
00:05:25,000 --> 00:05:27,930
Where did the injuries on your body really come from?

70
00:05:29,560 --> 00:05:31,030
Everything I said is true.

71
00:05:40,659 --> 00:05:41,530
My wife.

72
00:05:42,060 --> 00:05:42,830
What I said

73
00:05:43,200 --> 00:05:44,330
is the truth.

74
00:05:51,460 --> 00:05:52,990
My wife, what are you doing?

75
00:06:02,200 --> 00:06:03,730
I plan to leave here.

76
00:06:05,600 --> 00:06:06,230
I...

77
00:06:08,800 --> 00:06:10,030
I'll go with you.

78
00:06:10,760 --> 00:06:11,860
No need.

79
00:06:15,630 --> 00:06:16,230
Cangyuan,

80
00:06:16,600 --> 00:06:18,330
no matter what you want to hide.

81
00:06:18,760 --> 00:06:20,660
But don't get hurt for me again.

82
00:06:21,230 --> 00:06:22,560
As for my identity,

83
00:06:23,260 --> 00:06:25,120
I will definitely find it myself.

84
00:06:27,060 --> 00:06:28,920
Thank you for the wooden hairpin.

85
00:06:29,100 --> 00:06:30,430
I will always wear it.

86
00:06:41,100 --> 00:06:41,560
My wife.

87
00:06:41,600 --> 00:06:42,860
I'll go with you.

88
00:06:45,200 --> 00:06:46,159
I told you.

89
00:06:46,900 --> 00:06:47,830
Don't follow me.

90
00:06:50,900 --> 00:06:51,800
Only if I leave,

91
00:06:52,530 --> 00:06:54,030
can you be safe and sound.
